1. The proposed method is not novel. The three-step process of proposer, verifier, and reporter is similar to the Chain-of-Thought (CoT) and Tree-of-Thought (ToT) methods. The main difference is that the proposed method uses a DAG instead of a chain or tree to store and utilize all historically validated reasoning results. However, the authors do not provide any theoretical justification for why a DAG is better than a chain or tree.
